<title>UK: Berlin-Hannoversche Hypo sets 200 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Berlin-Hannoversche Hypo sets 200 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BERLIN-HANNOVERSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON    *3.95	MATURITY    21.MAY.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    20.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    BERLIN    DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *TILL 21.MAY.97 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR 4.65 PCT</p>
<p>		THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 57.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
